'''Sunny Celeboodle''' (夏セレブ, ''Natsu Serebu'', '''Summer Celeboodle''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Celeboodle]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sunny Celeboodle
|image = E 099.png
|first appearance = [[Boy Meats Girl]]
|latest appearance = [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Heavenly Tower - Floor 10]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Much like the original [[Celeboodle]], this enemy deals fairly high damage with few knockbacks, which is further exacerbated by her 400-range [[Area Attack|Area Attacks]], even when her longer attack cycle is factored in.

==Strategy==
Because of her high range, most units that she can hit are not able to deliver consistent DPS, so the use of backliners like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] are necessary to whittle her down from afar. [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] can also accumulate some burst damage, as could certain other melee units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] or [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]] at lower magnifiations.

